Package: libwyoming0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wyoming voice protocol library
 libwyoming is a C library implementing the Wyoming voice protocol
 used by Home Assistant for TTS, ASR, and other voice services.
 Provides client and server APIs over TCP with JSON-line framing
 and binary audio payloads.

Package: libwyoming-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libwyoming0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wyoming voice protocol library (development files)
 libwyoming is a C library implementing the Wyoming voice protocol
 used by Home Assistant for TTS, ASR, and other voice services.
 .
 This package contains the header files and pkg-config file needed
 to build programs that use libwyoming.

Package: wyoming-tools
Architecture: any
Section: sound
Depends: libwyoming0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wyoming voice protocol server binaries and tools
 Standalone Wyoming protocol servers and CLI tools:
 .
 wyoming-piper-server — TTS server using Piper (subprocess).
 wyoming-asr-server   — ASR server using Sherpa-ONNX (native C).
                         Supports Whisper, Zipformer, Paraformer.
 wyoming-describe     — CLI tool to query any Wyoming server.
 .
 Includes systemd service files for wyoming-piper and wyoming-asr.
 Compatible with Home Assistant, kerchunk, and any Wyoming client.
